From b9dd5ca1c1758c9eef87cc4e160afb9c57427deb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gabriel Fernandez <gabriel.fernandez@foss.st.com>
Date: Tue, 5 Dec 2023 08:20:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 0145/1695] drivers: clk: stm32mp15: apply full clock tree in
 OP-TEE

OPTEE is now able to re-configure all clock tree.
RCC bindings is also aligned with MP13:
- merge of 'st,clksrc' and 'st,pkcs' nodes into 'st,clksrc'
- no ordering requirements on 'st,clksrc' node
- use DIV() macro for 'st,clkdiv' node
- no ordering requirements on 'st,clkdiv' node
- new pll binding

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 4e0044b2f9571363e135df63f213a7719c6e111b drivers: clk: stm32mp15: apply full clock tree in OP-TEE]
Change-Id: Ifdc18c8ece431f7a6d9a7d3126d3c85677871527
Signed-off-by: Gabriel Fernandez <gabriel.fernandez@foss.st.com>
